<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dow Jones cut to reduce.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dow Jones cut to reduce.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- A.G. Edwards analyst Michael Kupinski said he downgraded Dow Jones &amp; Co to reduce from maintain.</p>
<p>-- said cut the 1997 earnings estimate to $1.20 a share from $1.70 a share. Set a 1998 earnings estimate of $1.00 a share.</p>
<p>-- cited company's &quot;uninspiring&quot; near-term earnings outlook.     -- set a 12-18 month price target of $30 a share.</p>
<p>-- Dow Jones gained 2 to 37-1/2 in afternoon exchange trading.</p>
</text>
